35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The last hiring took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, that is bad. We have no freeze window in winter.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, the invoices show add-ons climbing yearly. Bundles held price.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I found the support was unowned for two days last winter.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, that confirms my fear. The 2018 data lift was a mess.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,The supervisors dropped the new steps within weeks. Training is weak.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The yard scanners are old. The 2021 tool failed quickly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,The board trims capital but approves operating costs easily. We must be careful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,The warehouse rules changed twice. The plan never survived a year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,The dispatch tool skipped upgrades. It is aging in place.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a vendor who stays. Not just a trainer.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,It must work with our old scanners. No fancy new hardware.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A bundled price is safer. Avoid separate licenses that creep up.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,We need one clear owner for support. No pointing fingers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need a system that can be upgraded without stopping everything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
